# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads to Cloud Build: only the code backend/Dockerfile needs.
# The model weights are not uploaded from here: the build fetches the registered model from MLflow's
# artifact store in Cloud Storage (deploy/cloudbuild.yaml, hippo.register_model).
# Never upload data/ or runs/: scans and labels stay on this machine.
# Check before building:  gcloud meta list-files-for-upload
*
!backend/
!backend/Dockerfile
!backend/Dockerfile.dockerignore
!requirements-api.txt
!src/
!src/hippo/
!src/hippo/**
!deploy/
!deploy/cloudbuild.yaml
# The upload page (webapp/Dockerfile, deploy/cloudbuild-webapp.yaml)
!webapp/
!webapp/Dockerfile
!webapp/Dockerfile.dockerignore
!requirements-webapp.txt
!streamlit_dashboard/
!streamlit_dashboard/upload_page.py
!deploy/cloudbuild-webapp.yaml
**/__pycache__/
